### 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "KAKAO",
  "accessToken": "replace-with-kakao-access-token"
}

### 내 정보 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/members/me
Authorization: Bearer replace-with-access-token

### 내 정보 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/members/me
Authorization: Bearer replace-with-access-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "누커",
  "profileImageUrl": "https://example.com/profile.png"
}

### 회원 탈퇴
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/members/me
Authorization: Bearer replace-with-access-token
